523359_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0iqBjYGpNvAQ7kNvwFpv2JS&_nc_oc=Ado2KB_-1b9R_EcMBn5bp1rI5S5nzjTsNK3g146AvKKrWkT_S5Hyu3MNP0iA38WNrrs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3hzmKUD5vKEPUgOvF5rOkuVQFycuYJNptI06t3L6spqg&oe=69F1F3C0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer COver.png", "id": "1288041185499986", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982466_1288041188833319_1651999487860440247_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Azx3uL3JwjsQ7kNvwGOLgDD&_nc_oc=AdqsAVPpS1Joa4Ip3KxpFzuxKbRA9WlyHwqQRO-lJfCSaMj21I1J4lzFTKOK2z8SpOY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1qSczq4UvVc3pYQO3ppJ92TkaY8wHe6b8WgPx2GqAGtA&oe=69F1F691"}, "display_name": "TinyFins", "keywords": ["cute", "highscore", "underwater", "fish", "mixedreality"], "long_description": "Tiny Fins lets you swim free in an ocean playground, guiding a school of cute fish with a sweep of your hand. Dive past colorful clams, snag bunches of bubbles, and avoid hungry sharks!\n\nWhy you will love it: Super-smooth controls that make sudden sprints and quick pivots a cinch when you\u2019re gliding through the water. They\u2019re a lifesaver when you go from popping a string of bubbles to deftly avoiding a spiky puffer fish!\n\nFeatures include:\n- Shark, pufferfish and squid enemies\n- Highscore system with the ability to unlock ranks and trophies\n- Intuitive, flowy controls\n- Collecting fish of different colors", "short_description": "Tiny Fins lets you swim free in an ocean playground, guiding a school of cute fish with a sweep of your hand. Dive past colorful clams, snag bunches of bubbles, and avoid hungry sharks!\n\nWhy you will love it: Super-smooth controls that make sudden sprints and quick pivots a cinch when you\u2019re gliding through the water. They\u2019re a lifesaver when you go from popping a string of bubbles to deftly avoiding a spiky puffer fish!"}]}, "developer_name": n